   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Old Mountaineer**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Wild Bill Jones**: back after 75 archived shows (568 days) [2]\n- **Lay Me Down**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Where The Dim Lights Are The Dimmest**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Nutshell**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Stone Walls & Steel Bars**: back after 124 archived shows (924 days); rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Ground Speed**: back after 110 archived shows (755 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-10-23.mk21.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 153 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-10-23.mk21.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk21 (ORTF wide) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [1]. Also: Signal chain ran through KCY and a Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 preamp into a Sony M10 recorder at 24-bit/96kHz; Transfer went from WAV through Sound Studio and xACT to FLAC at 24/96 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Concertlands: [Billy Strings Tickets - Oct 23 2026 - Orion Amphitheater - Huntsville, Alabama - ConcertLands](https://www.concertlands.com/events-aff/usa%20-%20alabama%20-%20huntsville%20-%207:30%20PM%20-%202026-10-23%20-%20the-orion-amphitheater%20-%202026) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings The Orion Amphitheater - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/the-orion-amphitheater/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings The Orion Amphitheater - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/the-orion-amphitheater/) [5]",
